// Action, TOML key, default chords, optional tier and deprecated aliases.
// Included by shortcuts.h for Action and shortcuts.cc for the settings table. The order is the order of the debug
// log, except that kSelectShip1 to kSelectShip8 must stay contiguous: ship_shortcut_hint.h indexes them.
